The rules for this repository live in two places, and nowhere else:

- `CLAUDE.md` — invariants of the system (surfaces, custody, scope, queues, deploy).
- `.ai/guidelines/` — the shape of the code, one file per concern; start at
  `.ai/guidelines/README.md`.

`tests/architecture/` is the machine-checked subset: if a rule and a test
disagree, the test is the rule.

Everything inside a `.go` file is English — identifiers, comments, error strings,
log messages, test names.
